                                                "sense_id": "c2a777ae-d74e-34e1-9c12-ed757d79a5c8",
                                                "text": "He will chafe at the doctor's marrying my daughter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3267db35-b649-4ba8-8f89-005da4c89f4d",
                                                "sense_id": "c2a777ae-d74e-34e1-9c12-ed757d79a5c8",
                                                "text": "Many local politicians chafed under the restrictions of Guided Democracy[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de458960-9fa7-45fa-b3e8-f124988778f4",
                                                "sense_id": "c2a777ae-d74e-34e1-9c12-ed757d79a5c8",
                                                "text": "As Meta has spent billions to bring in A.I. talent, some members of the old guard have chafed at the new hires, three people with knowledge of the matter said."
                                            }
